<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ADAC Labs starts as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ADAC Labs starts as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Friday it had started coverage of ADAC Laboratories Inc with a rating of buy.</p>
<p>-- The company's shares opened up 3/4 to 23.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
